    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Yeah, we could do that, but I initially didn't do it because `getShowPrevious` and `getShowMore` are calling `getFirstReceivedPage` and `getLastReceivedPage` and they don't have access to the result of cache.\r\n\r\nNow that we kind of agree on _\"do not store firstReceivedPage or lastReceivedPage in the upper scope\"_ part, I've changed the implementation to provide `cachedHits` to here and there. https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/pull/4534/commits/1e12727ca2a4a94a5459d6e66ba389a71f0a12e2\r\n\r\nWhat do you think?",
    "commit_id": "46eff263fdb05f0e1601a9be71e98e839511cda0",
